cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or cite Sanad, please cite it as below."
title: "Sanad v0.1: an open protocol for recomputable recognition of skills"
type: software
version: "0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-07"
url: "https://sanadprotocol.org/spec/0.1/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sanad-protocol/sanadprotocol.org"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
abstract: "Sanad is an open protocol in which a qualification is a chain of claim, evidence and signed attestations that anyone can recompute under their own policy. Draft; not accreditation; no token."
keywords:
  - skills
  - credentials
  - verifiable credentials
  - recognition of qualifications
  - open standard
authors:
